---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Portions derived from SafeStbTrueTypeSharp and stb_truetype
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

AN_Fonts is a fork of SafeStbTrueTypeSharp, Roman Shapiro's (rds1983) fully
memory-safe C# port of Sean Barrett's stb_truetype.h (version 1.24). Everything
up to and including upstream commit 2f76ecb (2020-03-07) is upstream work. The
original, freely-licensed code is available from its upstream repositories:

    SafeStbTrueTypeSharp:  https://github.com/StbSharp/SafeStbTrueTypeSharp
    stb_truetype.h:        https://github.com/nothings/stb

The portions of this software originating from SafeStbTrueTypeSharp are
Copyright (c) Roman Shapiro and were released by their author into the public
domain. stb_truetype.h is Copyright (c) 2017 Sean Barrett and is offered under
the recipient's choice of the MIT License or the public domain (Unlicense), per
the license block at the end of that file. Those terms continue to govern those
portions. Anyone wishing to use the freely-licensed code without the Artificial
Necessity additions should obtain it from the upstream repositories above.